# Lock line endings to LF regardless of OS or how files were copied in.
# Without this, Windows tools (Explorer copy/paste, some drag-and-drop
# uploads) introduce CRLF, and git then reports nearly every file as
# "modified" even though nothing actually changed — pure noise that
# buries real diffs. See promptove/11-resolved-2026-09-05.md.
* text=auto eol=lf
